    "v_4199ac07662b73e2_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 366.344828,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "一个六十四岁的老太太在菜摊前东挑西拣，摊主见她衣服打满补丁，翻了个白眼，对她说，冬笋很贵的买不起，就别碰。老太太一愣，没说话，默默走了。小摊主哪里知道他刚刚羞辱的这个人是中国物理界第一位女院士，是被西方国家称为中国国的居里夫人的核物理科学家。她手里随便一项成果都够拿诺贝尔奖。更讽刺的是，她住的房子破破烂烂，却把价值上亿的苏州园林祖宅网师园无偿捐给了国家，他叫何泽惠。一九一四年，何泽慧出生在苏州的名门望族，他家祖上出过十五名进士，二十九、五个举人，兄弟姐妹，八个人出了六个院士。一九三二年，十八岁的何泽会参加高考，三千多人报考清华物理系，他考了第一名，结果开学没几天，系主任叶启孙找他谈话，说，女生学物理难有成就，劝他转系，何则，惠当场就火了。您这是歧视女性救国，何分男女就这么着，他应留在了物理系。毕业那年，物理系大半，男生因为课程太难退了学，他稳稳拿了全系第一。第二名是一个叫钱三强的男生，两个人在清华就互相欣赏，但谁也没捅破那层窗户纸，真正让他们下定决心走。科技救国这条路的是一次毕业考察。一九三六年，他们坐火车去外地考察，整节车厢的中国学生都挤在过道里，站着所有座位上堆满的日本人要倾销到中国的货物。在自己的国土上，中国人连个坐的地方都没有碰一下货物都会遭到训斥。满车厢的中国人敢怒不敢言，何则。惠攥紧了拳头。那一刻，他明白了，国家弱，老百姓连头都抬不起来。毕业后前三强去了法国学核物理，何泽会去了德国柏林高等工业大学，学的是弹道学，说白了就是研究枪炮子弹的整个专业。就他一个外国学生还是个女的。导师觉得奇怪，问他，你一个女孩子来学军工干什么？何作会说，我就是要打败日本侵略者。一九四三年，他凭借子弹飞行速度的研究拿下博士学位，随后进入海德堡威廉皇家核物理研究院。三十一岁那年，他发现了正负电子弹性碰撞现象，英国自然杂志称之为科学珍品。可他一点儿也高兴不起来。战争爆发，他和国内的亲人彻底失联了。彷徨无助的时候，他想起了远在法国的前三强，异国他乡，两个人开始书信往来，互相依靠。有一天，何泽慧收到一封信，打开一看，整封信，只有二十五个单词，翻译过来是这样写的。我向你提出结婚的请求，如能同意，我将等你一同回国。何则慧的回信更短，感谢你的爱情，我将对你永远忠诚。等我们见面后一同回国。一九四四六年，两人在巴黎结婚，双双进入居里实验室工作。婚后第二年，何泽惠在实验室里首次观测到了游河的三分裂和四分裂现象。这是什么概念？这是核爆炸的核心基本原理，是诺奖级别的发现。消息一出，整个科学界都炸了。各国媒体尊称他为中国的居里夫人。法国政府破格晋升前三强，为研究导师各种优厚待遇摆在他们面前，只要他们愿意下半辈子，可以在法国过最顶尖的科研生活，诺贝尔奖也只是时间问题。但一九四八年，他们做了一个让所有人都看不懂的决定放弃法国的高薪顶尖实验室和一切荣誉。带着不足半岁的女儿回中国。有人问他们为什么何则？会说我们学的就是要回来。没有说去了，不想回来的。故事讲到这儿，你可能以为回国之后就是鲜花和掌声。没有等待，他们的是一个原子能事业完全空白的中国，是西方国家的技术封锁，是苏联专家突然撤走的烂摊子。还有后来那段谁也想不到的遭遇，他回国后到底经历了什么？他又是怎么在一穷二白的条件下帮中国造出原子弹和氢弹的下集。告诉你，看到这儿先别划走，点个赞，是对这位老太太的敬意。收藏起来讲，给你的孩子听真正的明星，从来不是舞台上的那些人，转发给更多人，让合泽会这个名字被更多人记住。关注我，下集更狠。他帮中国造出了原子弹氢弹，功劳簿上却没有他的名名字。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 4290,
      "text": "一个六十四岁的老太太在菜摊前东挑西拣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5070,
      "end_ms": 7150,
      "text": "摊主见她衣服打满补丁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00003",
      "start_ms": 7410,
      "end_ms": 8350,
      "text": "翻了个白眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8370,
      "end_ms": 8890,
      "text": "对她说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9550,
      "end_ms": 11770,
      "text": "冬笋很贵的买不起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11770,
      "end_ms": 12370,
      "text": "就别碰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13750,
      "end_ms": 14690,
      "text": "老太太一愣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00008",
      "start_ms": 15110,
      "end_ms": 15830,
      "text": "没说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16350,
      "end_ms": 17210,
      "text": "默默走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00010",
      "start_ms": 18190,
      "end_ms": 26010,
      "text": "小摊主哪里知道他刚刚羞辱的这个人是中国物理界第一位女院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26910,
      "end_ms": 33340,
      "text": "是被西方国家称为中国国的居里夫人的核物理科学家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00012",
      "start_ms": 33660,
      "end_ms": 37640,
      "text": "她手里随便一项成果都够拿诺贝尔奖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00013",
      "start_ms": 38480,
      "end_ms": 39740,
      "text": "更讽刺的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00014",
      "start_ms": 39820,
      "end_ms": 41660,
      "text": "她住的房子破破烂烂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00015",
      "start_ms": 42200,
      "end_ms": 48780,
      "text": "却把价值上亿的苏州园林祖宅网师园无偿捐给了国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00016",
      "start_ms": 49320,
      "end_ms": 50460,
      "text": "他叫何泽惠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00017",
      "start_ms": 51100,
      "end_ms": 52260,
      "text": "一九一四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00018",
      "start_ms": 52700,
      "end_ms": 56080,
      "text": "何泽慧出生在苏州的名门望族，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00019",
      "start_ms": 56700,
      "end_ms": 59020,
      "text": "他家祖上出过十五名进士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00020",
      "start_ms": 59380,
      "end_ms": 60750,
      "text": "二十九、五个举人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00021",
      "start_ms": 60990,
      "end_ms": 61870,
      "text": "兄弟姐妹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00022",
      "start_ms": 61870,
      "end_ms": 63865,
      "text": "八个人出了六个院士。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00023",
      "start_ms": 64360,
      "end_ms": 65425,
      "text": "一九三二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00024",
      "start_ms": 65770,
      "end_ms": 68530,
      "text": "十八岁的何泽会参加高考，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00025",
      "start_ms": 68890,
      "end_ms": 71425,
      "text": "三千多人报考清华物理系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00026",
      "start_ms": 71970,
      "end_ms": 72945,
      "text": "他考了第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00027",
      "start_ms": 73410,
      "end_ms": 74670,
      "text": "结果开学没几天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00028",
      "start_ms": 74770,
      "end_ms": 76730,
      "text": "系主任叶启孙找他谈话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00029",
      "start_ms": 77070,
      "end_ms": 77310,
      "text": "说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00030",
      "start_ms": 77350,
      "end_ms": 79170,
      "text": "女生学物理难有成就，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00031",
      "start_ms": 79470,
      "end_ms": 80515,
      "text": "劝他转系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00032",
      "start_ms": 81090,
      "end_ms": 81530,
      "text": "何则，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00033",
      "start_ms": 81530,
      "end_ms": 82955,
      "text": "惠当场就火了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00034",
      "start_ms": 83350,
      "end_ms": 86095,
      "text": "您这是歧视女性救国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00035",
      "start_ms": 86460,
      "end_ms": 89665,
      "text": "何分男女就这么着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00036",
      "start_ms": 90100,
      "end_ms": 91815,
      "text": "他应留在了物理系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00037",
      "start_ms": 92320,
      "end_ms": 93020,
      "text": "毕业那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00038",
      "start_ms": 93240,
      "end_ms": 94120,
      "text": "物理系大半，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00039",
      "start_ms": 94120,
      "end_ms": 96465,
      "text": "男生因为课程太难退了学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00040",
      "start_ms": 97060,
      "end_ms": 99145,
      "text": "他稳稳拿了全系第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00041",
      "start_ms": 99600,
      "end_ms": 102645,
      "text": "第二名是一个叫钱三强的男生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00042",
      "start_ms": 103290,
      "end_ms": 105775,
      "text": "两个人在清华就互相欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00043",
      "start_ms": 106170,
      "end_ms": 108665,
      "text": "但谁也没捅破那层窗户纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00044",
      "start_ms": 109210,
      "end_ms": 111290,
      "text": "真正让他们下定决心走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00045",
      "start_ms": 111290,
      "end_ms": 114405,
      "text": "科技救国这条路的是一次毕业考察。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00046",
      "start_ms": 116380,
      "end_ms": 117385,
      "text": "一九三六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00047",
      "start_ms": 118080,
      "end_ms": 120555,
      "text": "他们坐火车去外地考察，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00048",
      "start_ms": 121410,
      "end_ms": 124530,
      "text": "整节车厢的中国学生都挤在过道里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00049",
      "start_ms": 124530,
      "end_ms": 130485,
      "text": "站着所有座位上堆满的日本人要倾销到中国的货物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00050",
      "start_ms": 131040,
      "end_ms": 132320,
      "text": "在自己的国土上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00051",
      "start_ms": 132520,
      "end_ms": 137785,
      "text": "中国人连个坐的地方都没有碰一下货物都会遭到训斥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00052",
      "start_ms": 138620,
      "end_ms": 141875,
      "text": "满车厢的中国人敢怒不敢言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00053",
      "start_ms": 142790,
      "end_ms": 143210,
      "text": "何则。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00054",
      "start_ms": 143210,
      "end_ms": 145115,
      "text": "惠攥紧了拳头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00055",
      "start_ms": 145460,
      "end_ms": 145900,
      "text": "那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00056",
      "start_ms": 145900,
      "end_ms": 146635,
      "text": "他明白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00057",
      "start_ms": 146960,
      "end_ms": 147620,
      "text": "国家弱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00058",
      "start_ms": 147920,
      "end_ms": 149985,
      "text": "老百姓连头都抬不起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00059",
      "start_ms": 150520,
      "end_ms": 153505,
      "text": "毕业后前三强去了法国学核物理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00060",
      "start_ms": 153920,
      "end_ms": 157095,
      "text": "何泽会去了德国柏林高等工业大学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00061",
      "start_ms": 157620,
      "end_ms": 158985,
      "text": "学的是弹道学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00062",
      "start_ms": 159500,
      "end_ms": 163785,
      "text": "说白了就是研究枪炮子弹的整个专业。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00063",
      "start_ms": 164380,
      "end_ms": 166915,
      "text": "就他一个外国学生还是个女的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00064",
      "start_ms": 167770,
      "end_ms": 168775,
      "text": "导师觉得奇怪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00065",
      "start_ms": 169490,
      "end_ms": 170045,
      "text": "问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00066",
      "start_ms": 170410,
      "end_ms": 173435,
      "text": "你一个女孩子来学军工干什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00067",
      "start_ms": 174270,
      "end_ms": 175065,
      "text": "何作会说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00068",
      "start_ms": 176000,
      "end_ms": 177955,
      "text": "我就是要打败日本侵略者。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00069",
      "start_ms": 178500,
      "end_ms": 179445,
      "text": "一九四三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00070",
      "start_ms": 179890,
      "end_ms": 184090,
      "text": "他凭借子弹飞行速度的研究拿下博士学位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00071",
      "start_ms": 184610,
      "end_ms": 188150,
      "text": "随后进入海德堡威廉皇家核物理研究院。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00072",
      "start_ms": 188310,
      "end_ms": 189590,
      "text": "三十一岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00073",
      "start_ms": 189890,
      "end_ms": 193370,
      "text": "他发现了正负电子弹性碰撞现象，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00074",
      "start_ms": 194090,
      "end_ms": 197310,
      "text": "英国自然杂志称之为科学珍品。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00075",
      "start_ms": 197870,
      "end_ms": 199770,
      "text": "可他一点儿也高兴不起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00076",
      "start_ms": 200370,
      "end_ms": 201270,
      "text": "战争爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00077",
      "start_ms": 201730,
      "end_ms": 204250,
      "text": "他和国内的亲人彻底失联了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00078",
      "start_ms": 204670,
      "end_ms": 206170,
      "text": "彷徨无助的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00079",
      "start_ms": 206270,
      "end_ms": 209435,
      "text": "他想起了远在法国的前三强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00080",
      "start_ms": 209860,
      "end_ms": 210700,
      "text": "异国他乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00081",
      "start_ms": 211360,
      "end_ms": 213200,
      "text": "两个人开始书信往来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00082",
      "start_ms": 213460,
      "end_ms": 214340,
      "text": "互相依靠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00083",
      "start_ms": 214780,
      "end_ms": 215420,
      "text": "有一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00084",
      "start_ms": 215840,
      "end_ms": 217880,
      "text": "何泽慧收到一封信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00085",
      "start_ms": 218480,
      "end_ms": 219300,
      "text": "打开一看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00086",
      "start_ms": 219780,
      "end_ms": 220560,
      "text": "整封信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00087",
      "start_ms": 220880,
      "end_ms": 222480,
      "text": "只有二十五个单词，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00088",
      "start_ms": 223400,
      "end_ms": 225000,
      "text": "翻译过来是这样写的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00089",
      "start_ms": 225000,
      "end_ms": 226900,
      "text": "我向你提出结婚的请求，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00090",
      "start_ms": 227320,
      "end_ms": 228220,
      "text": "如能同意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00091",
      "start_ms": 228460,
      "end_ms": 230200,
      "text": "我将等你一同回国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00092",
      "start_ms": 231100,
      "end_ms": 232640,
      "text": "何则慧的回信更短，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00093",
      "start_ms": 233000,
      "end_ms": 234080,
      "text": "感谢你的爱情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00094",
      "start_ms": 234440,
      "end_ms": 236060,
      "text": "我将对你永远忠诚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00095",
      "start_ms": 236480,
      "end_ms": 238480,
      "text": "等我们见面后一同回国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00096",
      "start_ms": 238480,
      "end_ms": 240115,
      "text": "一九四四六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00097",
      "start_ms": 240420,
      "end_ms": 241835,
      "text": "两人在巴黎结婚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00098",
      "start_ms": 242180,
      "end_ms": 244835,
      "text": "双双进入居里实验室工作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00099",
      "start_ms": 245450,
      "end_ms": 246490,
      "text": "婚后第二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00100",
      "start_ms": 246710,
      "end_ms": 253055,
      "text": "何泽惠在实验室里首次观测到了游河的三分裂和四分裂现象。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00101",
      "start_ms": 253670,
      "end_ms": 254675,
      "text": "这是什么概念？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00102",
      "start_ms": 255770,
      "end_ms": 258550,
      "text": "这是核爆炸的核心基本原理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00103",
      "start_ms": 258610,
      "end_ms": 260535,
      "text": "是诺奖级别的发现。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00104",
      "start_ms": 261130,
      "end_ms": 261950,
      "text": "消息一出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00105",
      "start_ms": 262070,
      "end_ms": 263555,
      "text": "整个科学界都炸了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00106",
      "start_ms": 264160,
      "end_ms": 268485,
      "text": "各国媒体尊称他为中国的居里夫人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00107",
      "start_ms": 269230,
      "end_ms": 271530,
      "text": "法国政府破格晋升前三强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00108",
      "start_ms": 271530,
      "end_ms": 275965,
      "text": "为研究导师各种优厚待遇摆在他们面前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00109",
      "start_ms": 276450,
      "end_ms": 278790,
      "text": "只要他们愿意下半辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00110",
      "start_ms": 278790,
      "end_ms": 281785,
      "text": "可以在法国过最顶尖的科研生活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00111",
      "start_ms": 282580,
      "end_ms": 285085,
      "text": "诺贝尔奖也只是时间问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00112",
      "start_ms": 286080,
      "end_ms": 287145,
      "text": "但一九四八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00113",
      "start_ms": 287640,
      "end_ms": 296670,
      "text": "他们做了一个让所有人都看不懂的决定放弃法国的高薪顶尖实验室和一切荣誉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00114",
      "start_ms": 296950,
      "end_ms": 299870,
      "text": "带着不足半岁的女儿回中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00115",
      "start_ms": 300570,
      "end_ms": 303070,
      "text": "有人问他们为什么何则？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00116",
      "start_ms": 303070,
      "end_ms": 305495,
      "text": "会说我们学的就是要回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00117",
      "start_ms": 306010,
      "end_ms": 307030,
      "text": "没有说去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00118",
      "start_ms": 307030,
      "end_ms": 308130,
      "text": "不想回来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00119",
      "start_ms": 308490,
      "end_ms": 309630,
      "text": "故事讲到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00120",
      "start_ms": 309630,
      "end_ms": 312810,
      "text": "你可能以为回国之后就是鲜花和掌声。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00121",
      "start_ms": 313550,
      "end_ms": 314890,
      "text": "没有等待，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00122",
      "start_ms": 314910,
      "end_ms": 319030,
      "text": "他们的是一个原子能事业完全空白的中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00123",
      "start_ms": 319630,
      "end_ms": 321829,
      "text": "是西方国家的技术封锁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00124",
      "start_ms": 322270,
      "end_ms": 325490,
      "text": "是苏联专家突然撤走的烂摊子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00125",
      "start_ms": 325730,
      "end_ms": 329090,
      "text": "还有后来那段谁也想不到的遭遇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00126",
      "start_ms": 329210,
      "end_ms": 331230,
      "text": "他回国后到底经历了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00127",
      "start_ms": 331530,
      "end_ms": 338040,
      "text": "他又是怎么在一穷二白的条件下帮中国造出原子弹和氢弹的下集。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00128",
      "start_ms": 338040,
      "end_ms": 338560,
      "text": "告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00129",
      "start_ms": 339480,
      "end_ms": 341200,
      "text": "看到这儿先别划走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00130",
      "start_ms": 341760,
      "end_ms": 342400,
      "text": "点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00131",
      "start_ms": 343600,
      "end_ms": 345700,
      "text": "是对这位老太太的敬意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00132",
      "start_ms": 345880,
      "end_ms": 347380,
      "text": "收藏起来讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00133",
      "start_ms": 347420,
      "end_ms": 350300,
      "text": "给你的孩子听真正的明星，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00134",
      "start_ms": 350700,
      "end_ms": 352860,
      "text": "从来不是舞台上的那些人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00135",
      "start_ms": 353280,
      "end_ms": 354660,
      "text": "转发给更多人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00136",
      "start_ms": 355280,
      "end_ms": 358380,
      "text": "让合泽会这个名字被更多人记住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00137",
      "start_ms": 358840,
      "end_ms": 359500,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00138",
      "start_ms": 359680,
      "end_ms": 360520,
      "text": "下集更狠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00139",
      "start_ms": 360860,
      "end_ms": 363880,
      "text": "他帮中国造出了原子弹氢弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4199ac07662b73e2_s00140",
      "start_ms": 363920,
      "end_ms": 366245,
      "text": "功劳簿上却没有他的名名字。"
    }
  ],
